@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = COLE_TOKEN_SUPER_ADMIN_AQUI

### Health Redis com latência e filas
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/redis

### Health Queues
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/queues

### Queue Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/queues/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Queue Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/queues/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar DLQ
GET {{baseUrl}}/queues/dlq?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reprocessar job da DLQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/queues/dlq/COLE_JOB_ID_AQUI/reprocessar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scheduler Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teste scheduler aniversários
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/teste/aniversarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teste scheduler lembretes
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/teste/lembretes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teste scheduler pacotes vencidos
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/teste/pacotes-vencidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teste scheduler campanhas
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/teste/campanhas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Teste scheduler relatórios
POST {{baseUrl}}/scheduler/teste/relatorios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
